{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0563_1000_p", "source_sha256": "26275d2b0aa0d37b6db80e15b642c055ee3e8b48e12543f5a0d99b9b2857c603", "ja": "（仕事が早く終わった帰り道。駄菓子を売ってるお店を\n見つけたので、このみさんと寄り道をしている）", "zh": "（工作提前结束后，在回去的路上发现了一家卖粗点心的小店，于是和这个美小姐一起顺道逛了逛。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0563_1001_039kon", "source_sha256": "db2d03c89423b3dcb6de10eab35e26061db7b3e42e874b68279d5365ea00b7c5", "ja": "ん～、美味しかった♪　久しぶりに食べたけど、\n大人になっても変わらない美味しさね。", "zh": "嗯～，真好吃♪ 好久没吃了，不过就算长大了，这味道还是一如既往地美味呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0563_1002_p", "source_sha256": "10b505cb3feec972a1d7172cdc621ec2be06a38eeb02547f42a863320b05435e", "ja": "ほんと懐かしいですね。\n俺も子供の頃、よく食べてましたよ。", "zh": "真的好怀念啊。\n我小时候也经常吃呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0563_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "1a8d10e34a264ff587145c17e4aca359776f3aaa21d3e4fa3b03d0eaa69f5322", "ja": "フフッ、みんなの思い出の味ってわけね。\n私も妹と一緒に食べてたわ。", "zh": "呵呵，也就是说，这是大家记忆中的味道呢。\n我以前也和妹妹一起吃过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0563_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "479321b0782665d0feea45f277df33ea9b72c477f29ad1d82d90615419450d71", "ja": "最後のひとつを妹と分けたんだけど、\nどっちが大きいかで言い合いになったりしてね。", "zh": "我和妹妹分最后一个的时候，\n还会为哪半块比较大吵起来呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0563_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e742e60b185a9b9ab3569958ddf81bcf04ab2ce3df95ec46f94293cf7c178fdf", "ja": "はは、微笑ましいですね。\n喧嘩の理由が子供らしいというか。", "zh": "哈哈，真是令人会心一笑。\n吵架的理由也很孩子气呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0563_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "e182ca08d392b484afb6f3bbca2a169b3a4fe10546cfaa895e595ddcb8168a76", "ja": "そうね。今となってはいい思い出だわ。\nウフフッ♪", "zh": "是啊。现在回想起来，倒是一段美好的回忆呢。\n呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0563_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "81162a92889e7d76e615e97cb20d404add189c7b2050a91f416dbfc22e3a68bf", "ja": "それに……駄菓子を食べると、\n昔の思い出が色々蘇ってくるのよね。", "zh": "而且……一吃粗点心，过去的各种回忆就会纷纷浮现出来呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0563_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "231dcdb79c1c4f15dcbf977bee1c4fc2a4e09c5ca39ad1613fff4629349b9f90", "ja": "友達の家で食べたり、遠足の時に交換したり……。\nなんか、すごく懐かしい気分になっちゃった。", "zh": "在朋友家里一起吃，或者远足的时候互相交换……不知不觉就特别怀念过去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0563_1009_p", "source_sha256": "5bc5d0eeeb007675727d7fe90345751e86d5b2cd22c60e5313dc44c95fb65376", "ja": "その気持ち、わかります。\n大人になって、食べる機会が減ったから余計に。", "zh": "我明白那种感觉。长大以后，吃到的机会变少了，所以更觉得怀念。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0563_1010_039kon", "source_sha256": "5304bc6377fd96a86061e49bc188516d9a77f35518dab1ef327032aed325a673", "ja": "……そうだわ！　せっかくだから、\nみんなへのお土産に、いくつか買って帰りましょうか。", "zh": "……对了！难得来一趟，\n要不要买几份伴手礼带回去送给剧场的大家？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0563_1011_p", "source_sha256": "fad6fdd9003343e60d08153142fbd0748cfa22eb04aa47837fdc4db41d9075d6", "ja": "劇場のみんなへ、ですか？", "zh": "是给剧场的大家吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0563_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "7f35823f105c6dc0b8d09b53587ae831a3f653e2bb99344c10760354fe9c6eec", "ja": "ええ。{$P$}も言ったでしょ？\n大人になると、駄菓子を食べる機会が減るって。", "zh": "是的。{$P$}也说过吧？\n长大以后，吃粗点心的机会就会变少。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0563_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "8ef180f10a452637913c24e3f9fd9ddf15a1b43f0c14436c343d7be700348909", "ja": "だからこそ、私たちで機会を作るの！　きっとみんな、\n喜んでくれると思うんだけど、どうかしら？", "zh": "正因为如此，我们才要自己创造机会！我觉得大家一定都会很开心的，你觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0563_1014_p", "source_sha256": "efd89ee9fa3db8f93be43ca08568483a2dc690481bcacb901a37fda9713d96fa", "ja": "いいですね！　小さい子たちも喜ぶと思いますが\n大人になっても、やっぱり嬉しいですからね。", "zh": "很棒的想法！不仅年纪小的孩子们会高兴，\n就算长成大人了，也一样会很开心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0563_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "920ec21b7d3526988b007b73cd3f173fc60d2fb36d431f507a1eda957d9e3ef7", "ja": "ええ。そうと決まったら、早速買い物ね！\nまた素敵な思い出が増えそうだわ。フフッ♪", "zh": "嗯。既然决定了，那就马上去买东西吧！\n感觉又要增添一段美好的回忆了。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
